			<div class="content" id="post-content-3593981">
									

<p>White-out text works well for adding touches of flair - Easter eggs and the like&#8230;it doesn't work well for an entire piece though. I'd consider simply taking out the white text and presenting the Tale normally - see if that doesn't reverse some votes.</p>
<p>For what it's worth, it's not terribly written, and I could see myself upvoting if I didn't have to read through opening the page source.</p>
<p>See <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/i-forget-myself-in-this-wondrous-night">I Forget Myself in This Wondrous Night</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/paradigm-shift">Paradigm Shift</a> for examples of what I'm talking about.</p>

